WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:02.202
Ukraine's president is visiting Finland.

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:03.370
NATO's newest member

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:05.205
sharing a border with Russia.

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:07.140
He's just been speaking in the wake

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.375
of those accusations

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.010
from Russia of a drone strike

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.144
on the Kremlin.

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:12.879
Let's hear what he had to say.

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:15.515
We don't attack

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.550
Putin or Moscow.

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:22.055
We fly, too, on on our territory.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.758
We are defending our religious cities.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.793
We don't have,

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:29.095
you know, enough weapons for these

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:32.432
That's why we don't use it anywhere.

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:34.868
So for us, that is a deficit.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:36.469
We can't stand it.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:39.239
And we didn't attack Putin.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:43.009
But we leave it to tribunal

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.314
 

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.884
 

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:53.186
 

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.221
from the Swedish public broadcaster.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:56.189
And my question

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:57.857
is also to President Zelensky,

00:00:57.857 --> 00:00:59.492
just a little follow up on what

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:00.660
you just said.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.029
Why do you think it is

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:04.597
in the interest of President

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:07.834
Putin to accuse Ukraine of trying to

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:09.436
assassinate him? Thank you.

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:12.939
 

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:15.842
 

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:16.642
 

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:20.013
 

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:22.549
 

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:26.319
he can no longer motivate his public.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.556
He cannot send

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:32.258
his servicemen to die just like

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:34.861
nothing happens.

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:37.230
He has no victories on the battlefield.

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:40.366
Second of all means the world is lost.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.435
They find themselves

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.437
capable of occupying Ukraine,

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:47.807
which they've got to hide from us.

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:51.111
And now he has to motivate somehow

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:51.945
those people.

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:54.314
He has to kill them going forward.

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:57.851
Like it's ex-convicts

00:01:58.218 --> 00:01:59.152
who cannot go back

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:00.720
because they will be shocked

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.322
by the blocking squads.

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:03.790
This is their current position.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:04.958
This is what is happening

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.459
in the military.

00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:07.427
Our top story right

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:08.661
now, Moscow is claiming

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:10.430
that Ukraine tried to assassinate

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:11.331
President Vladimir

00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:12.599
Putin with drone

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:14.334
strikes on the Kremlin last night.

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:15.969
Videos are circulating

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:18.138
purporting to show the alleged attacks.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:21.341
But at this stage, we cannot verify them.

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:24.043
Here they are. Take a look at that drone.

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:25.912
Moscow is calling the alleged strikes

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:27.347
a terrorist act

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:29.115
and says it reserves the right

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:30.984
to take retaliatory measures.

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:31.818
Ukraine denies

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:33.186
any involvement saying

00:02:33.186 --> 00:02:34.988
it does not attack other countries.

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.724
We've got team coverage on our story.

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:39.826
Standing by for us.

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.027
I'd like

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:42.662
we've got I've just got confirmation

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:43.363
that Matthew Chance

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:44.531
is with us from London.

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:45.598
And we've got Nic Robertson

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:47.400
as well in eastern Ukraine.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.103
Great to have you both with me today.

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:51.671
Nick,

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:52.572
I want to start

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:53.806
with what we've been hearing

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:55.074
from Ukraine,

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.544
in particular distancing themselves

00:02:58.378 --> 00:02:59.812
from this attack.

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:01.915
But I want to

00:03:01.915 --> 00:03:02.248
sort of

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:03.583
take a step back here

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:06.419
and talk about the potential impact

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:08.188
of these accusations

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:09.222
and the information

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:10.323
that we're getting through from the

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:11.524
Kremlin at this stage.

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:16.062
Typically in the past, the

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:17.230
Kremlin has said

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:20.233
things that is then used to act upon

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:23.636
things that have proven not to be true,

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:25.405
but have given them the pretext

00:03:25.405 --> 00:03:28.107
for an attack, a false flag operation.

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:31.444
Ukraine appears concerned

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:34.747
that this may be such an instance.

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:36.115
They feel that

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:38.551
perhaps the Kremlin will use

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:40.320
what happened over

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:40.887
the Kremlin

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:43.022
with these two alleged incidents

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:43.656
with drones.

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:44.857
60 minutes apart

00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:46.593
over the Kremlin last night

00:03:46.593 --> 00:03:47.694
to use that

00:03:47.694 --> 00:03:48.895
as a pretext

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:51.464
for some sort of attack on Ukraine.

00:03:51.931 --> 00:03:52.832
They're concerned

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:53.633
because Russia

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:55.602
has a track record of doing that.

00:03:55.602 --> 00:03:57.971
Ukraine says it is not connected

00:03:57.971 --> 00:04:00.106
to these drone incidents.

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.708
It says it will use all means

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:03.509
to defend its own territory,

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:05.612
to defend its own territory.

00:04:05.612 --> 00:04:06.746
It describes

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:08.548
the Russia's claims

00:04:08.548 --> 00:04:10.250
that this was an assassination

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.918
attempt on President Putin

00:04:11.918 --> 00:04:13.987
as part of Russian trickery.

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:16.556
They suggest is the Kremlin

00:04:16.556 --> 00:04:17.991
trying to drive up

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:19.125
support for the war

00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:21.160
in Ukraine ahead of the very important

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:22.228
May Day

00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:24.330
celebrations outside the Kremlin

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.832
on Red Square.

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:27.600
Very big annual celebrations

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:28.635
on the 9th of May

00:04:28.635 --> 00:04:31.471
that celebrate and commemorate

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:33.339
the huge loss of life.

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:35.541
10 million tens of millions of Russians

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:36.509
who lost their lives

00:04:36.509 --> 00:04:38.678
during the Second World War.

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:40.246
This is the Kremlin and President

00:04:40.246 --> 00:04:42.849
Putin trying to sort of build up support

00:04:43.383 --> 00:04:46.486
for that parade for the war in Ukraine.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.321
But I think when you

00:04:48.321 --> 00:04:49.622
when you do step back

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:51.524
and try and analyze the situation

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:53.293
it is a particularly tense situation

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:54.027
because Russia

00:04:54.027 --> 00:04:55.962
is expecting the possibility

00:04:55.962 --> 00:04:57.864
of Ukrainian counteroffensive.

00:04:57.864 --> 00:04:59.932
And there have been over the past

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:01.367
couple of weeks

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:02.802
a noticeable uptick

00:05:02.802 --> 00:05:05.071
in the number of incidents that have

00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:06.606
that have targeted Russia's

00:05:06.606 --> 00:05:09.008
supply lines and ammunition

00:05:09.008 --> 00:05:10.643
and fuel depots.

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:11.978
Inside of Russia,

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:14.580
but near the border with Ukraine.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.550
So when you take that picture

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:20.653
in its totality, Ukraine

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:23.556
and whether or not it was involved,

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:25.892
the fact that the Kremlin escalates

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:27.960
whatever it was to the level

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.129
of an attempted assassination

00:05:30.129 --> 00:05:31.698
of President Putin,

00:05:31.698 --> 00:05:32.899
Russia's taken this up

00:05:32.899 --> 00:05:35.735
to the maximum level that it can.

00:05:36.002 --> 00:05:38.137
And that's what would cause the concern

00:05:38.137 --> 00:05:40.807
of how Russia may then use this incident

00:05:41.474 --> 00:05:42.575
for its own purposes.

00:05:44.711 --> 00:05:45.678
Matthew, you know,

00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:46.546
we're looking at

00:05:46.546 --> 00:05:47.947
potential scenarios here.

00:05:47.947 --> 00:05:48.881
Here's what we do have.

00:05:48.881 --> 00:05:50.049
We have a video that we haven't

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:51.751
been able to to verify.

00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:52.251
But this is

00:05:52.251 --> 00:05:54.687
what Russian media is using right now.

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:55.722
The Kremlin saying

00:05:55.722 --> 00:05:56.889
there was an assassination

00:05:56.889 --> 00:05:58.758
attempt on Vladimir Putin.

00:05:58.758 --> 00:05:59.959
The Ukrainians saying

00:05:59.959 --> 00:06:01.828
we're distancing ourselves from this.

00:06:01.828 --> 00:06:02.628
But the messaging,

00:06:02.628 --> 00:06:02.995
I guess

00:06:02.995 --> 00:06:04.831
the underlying message to Russians

00:06:04.831 --> 00:06:07.800
is that the war has come to Russia.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.704
It has breached the Kremlin.

00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:12.672
Yeah.
And that's why

00:06:12.672 --> 00:06:13.573
it's so extraordinary

00:06:13.573 --> 00:06:15.942
that if this is an operation,

00:06:15.942 --> 00:06:17.076
a sort of full flag operation,

00:06:17.076 --> 00:06:18.344
it's been set up by the Russians.

00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:20.213
It's an extraordinarily risky one

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:22.348
because it is reminding Russians

00:06:22.782 --> 00:06:24.717
that this war is very real

00:06:24.717 --> 00:06:25.051
and that it

00:06:25.051 --> 00:06:26.786
is coming back to bite them,

00:06:26.786 --> 00:06:27.420
as it were, right

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:28.821
in the center of the capital.

00:06:28.821 --> 00:06:30.356
And the fact that this imagery

00:06:30.356 --> 00:06:32.658
is now on Russian television

00:06:32.658 --> 00:06:33.559
being watched by millions

00:06:33.559 --> 00:06:34.093
of people around

00:06:34.093 --> 00:06:35.995
the country is a remarkable

00:06:35.995 --> 00:06:38.931
sign of vulnerability and weakness

00:06:38.931 --> 00:06:39.899
on the part of the Kremlin.

00:06:39.899 --> 00:06:42.068
The fact that a drone or two drones

00:06:42.301 --> 00:06:42.969
could strike

00:06:42.969 --> 00:06:44.370
at the symbolic and political

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:45.938
and geographical heart

00:06:45.938 --> 00:06:47.940
of the Russian state is

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:50.176
is an extraordinary moment.

00:06:50.309 --> 00:06:52.912
I think that that will really ram home

00:06:53.279 --> 00:06:55.448
to people around the country in Russia,

00:06:55.948 --> 00:06:58.584
that this war is in a desperate,

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:01.354
desperate situation,

00:07:01.354 --> 00:07:02.455
not in terms of what

00:07:02.455 --> 00:07:03.556
the Russian response will be.

00:07:03.556 --> 00:07:04.123
Well,

00:07:04.123 --> 00:07:04.590
I mean, clearly,

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:05.792
the Russians are characterizing

00:07:05.792 --> 00:07:06.826
this as an assassination

00:07:06.826 --> 00:07:08.428
attempt against the

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:10.663
the Russian president, Vladimir Putin.

00:07:10.663 --> 00:07:12.098
And if it is real, by the way,

00:07:12.098 --> 00:07:12.765
then, you know,

00:07:12.765 --> 00:07:13.566
they have every right,

00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:14.534
I think,

00:07:14.534 --> 00:07:16.736
to take this extremely seriously.

00:07:16.869 --> 00:07:18.871
This is the presidential palace.

00:07:18.871 --> 00:07:20.173
This is where Vladimir Putin

00:07:20.173 --> 00:07:21.140
has an apartment,

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:21.774
although he wasn't said

00:07:21.774 --> 00:07:22.742
to be there at the time

00:07:22.742 --> 00:07:24.477
and is where he works in the daytime.

00:07:24.477 --> 00:07:26.813
It's where his official offices are

00:07:26.813 --> 00:07:27.847
for the most part of the week.

00:07:27.847 --> 00:07:28.748
And so,

00:07:29.015 --> 00:07:30.483
you know, it is a

00:07:30.483 --> 00:07:32.552
if it is a real attack

00:07:32.985 --> 00:07:34.921
and the pictures look real to me,

00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:38.458
I have to say, then it is a huge coup

00:07:39.258 --> 00:07:41.561
on the part of whoever carried it out

00:07:41.561 --> 00:07:42.962
at striking at the Russian state.

00:07:42.962 --> 00:07:44.297
And in terms of who carried out,

00:07:44.297 --> 00:07:45.832
the Ukrainians have distance themselves

00:07:45.832 --> 00:07:46.833
from this.

00:07:46.933 --> 00:07:49.068
They often do distance themselves

00:07:49.235 --> 00:07:49.802
from attacks

00:07:49.802 --> 00:07:50.403
that take place

00:07:50.403 --> 00:07:51.804
inside the territory

00:07:51.804 --> 00:07:53.606
of the Russian Federation.

00:07:53.606 --> 00:07:54.874
There are partizans

00:07:54.874 --> 00:07:57.009
partizan groups, Russians

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:58.978
who are active increasingly

00:07:58.978 --> 00:07:59.846
inside the country.

00:07:59.846 --> 00:08:00.813
And as Nic Robertson was

00:08:02.682 --> 00:08:03.716
kind of listing there,

00:08:03.716 --> 00:08:05.151
there have been a number of attacks

00:08:05.151 --> 00:08:06.152
in the past week

00:08:06.152 --> 00:08:06.953
against railway

00:08:06.953 --> 00:08:09.388
infrastructure targets, against an oil

00:08:09.889 --> 00:08:11.190
storage facility

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:13.192
in the south of the country as well,

00:08:13.192 --> 00:08:15.428
which are inside Russian territory.

00:08:15.761 --> 00:08:16.462
Now, some of these

00:08:16.462 --> 00:08:17.330
could have been carried out

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:20.600
by Ukrainian secret services, presumably

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.301
others could have been carried out

00:08:22.301 --> 00:08:24.136
by these partizan groups

00:08:24.136 --> 00:08:26.005
who are increasingly active

00:08:26.005 --> 00:08:29.642
and who are striking at various targets

00:08:29.642 --> 00:08:32.478
inside the Russian Federation,

00:08:32.678 --> 00:08:35.481
sometimes potentially with the assistance

00:08:35.648 --> 00:08:37.450
of elements of the Ukrainian state,

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:38.784
as well as the Ukrainians

00:08:38.784 --> 00:08:40.853
have been at pains to to deny

00:08:40.853 --> 00:08:41.654
any involvement

00:08:41.654 --> 00:08:44.624
in any of these kinds of incidents.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:45.758
One of the reasons

00:08:45.758 --> 00:08:47.393
the Ukrainians are denying it

00:08:47.393 --> 00:08:49.695
so ferociously is that

00:08:49.695 --> 00:08:52.532
there has been an absolute red line drawn

00:08:52.798 --> 00:08:54.834
by its main sponsors

00:08:54.834 --> 00:08:56.669
in the West, particularly United States,

00:08:56.669 --> 00:08:58.237
that it doesn't want to see

00:08:58.237 --> 00:09:01.440
Ukrainian attacks taking place inside

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:02.642
the Russian Federation,

00:09:02.642 --> 00:09:04.443
inside the territory of Russia.

00:09:04.443 --> 00:09:07.179
And in case that elicits a much

00:09:07.179 --> 00:09:09.982
more dramatic response from the Kremlin.

00:09:10.283 --> 00:09:12.318
Now, it was interesting to hear what

00:09:12.318 --> 00:09:13.286
Anthony Blinken, the U.S.

00:09:13.286 --> 00:09:13.953
secretary of state,

00:09:13.953 --> 00:09:15.388
said a few moments ago

00:09:15.388 --> 00:09:16.088
when he was asked

00:09:16.088 --> 00:09:17.590
about the possibility of Russia

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:18.891
sorry, of Ukraine

00:09:18.891 --> 00:09:20.893
striking at targets inside of Russia.

00:09:20.893 --> 00:09:23.229
He had a much more soft attitude

00:09:23.696 --> 00:09:25.131
towards that possibility, saying

00:09:25.131 --> 00:09:25.831
he was going to leave it up

00:09:25.831 --> 00:09:27.333
to the Ukrainians to decide

00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:28.434
how best to fight the war.

00:09:28.434 --> 00:09:29.869
That's a significant departure

00:09:29.869 --> 00:09:31.637
from ruling out

00:09:31.637 --> 00:09:34.540
any weapons being used to strike inside

00:09:34.907 --> 00:09:35.908
the Russian Federation.

00:09:35.908 --> 00:09:36.576
So it just

00:09:36.576 --> 00:09:37.176
looks like

00:09:37.176 --> 00:09:38.444
all these ways of sort

00:09:38.444 --> 00:09:40.713
of putting additional pressure on Russia

00:09:40.713 --> 00:09:42.214
as Ukraine prepares

00:09:42.214 --> 00:09:42.748
what is meant to be

00:09:42.748 --> 00:09:43.683
a spring offensive

00:09:43.683 --> 00:09:45.151
but is quickly turning into

00:09:45.151 --> 00:09:46.519
a summer offensive

00:09:46.519 --> 00:09:48.321
to retake Ukrainian land

00:09:48.321 --> 00:09:49.388
inside that country

00:09:49.388 --> 00:09:51.691
from Russian occupation forces

00:09:51.991 --> 00:09:55.761
and this drone strike on the Kremlin.

00:09:55.795 --> 00:09:56.696
If it's real

00:09:56.696 --> 00:09:58.564
and if it's not made up by the Russians,

00:09:58.564 --> 00:10:00.199
to kind of

00:10:00.199 --> 00:10:01.300
provide justification

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:02.401
for some kind of attack

00:10:02.401 --> 00:10:04.470
inside inside Ukraine,

00:10:04.804 --> 00:10:06.906
then that's a further example

